    "name": "Sparkfront: Online",
    "steam_appid": 3737860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Inspired by classic evolution battle games</strong>, <i>Sparkfront: Online</i> throws players into chaotic 1v1 battles where armies evolve across ages, towers fall, and strategy constantly shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're laughing over voice chat or locked in sweaty battles, every match is a fast, chaotic race to crush your opponent\u2019s tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fight through three unique ages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/2e32ffdbd71c0137efbec701476551df.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/2e32ffdbd71c0137efbec701476551df.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>The Primitive Age</strong> (clubs, spears, raw chaos)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>The Middle Age</strong> (knights, armor, steel clashes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>The Green Age</strong> (90s-style camo and modern warfare)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7a73751b8bcf7af5905f104996dd5651.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7a73751b8bcf7af5905f104996dd5651.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7a73751b8bcf7af5905f104996dd5651.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Loot drops from defeated enemies add tactical depth \u2014 stackable or single-use items that change the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/e353185f448722c736fb6cd506db5dca.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/e353185f448722c736fb6cd506db5dca.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/e353185f448722c736fb6cd506db5dca.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Shape your path with stat upgrades unlocked at every age \u2014 boost movement speed, turret damage, economy, or item drop rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7e8eadc916a8975c50330ff4f9753f3b.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7e8eadc916a8975c50330ff4f9753f3b.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7e8eadc916a8975c50330ff4f9753f3b.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Unpredictable Dropbox events spice up each match with sudden XP boosts, extra income, or short bursts of <strong>Frenzy Mode</strong> \u2014 rapid-fire, cost-free unit spam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/fc79d507e52ced2fde8f88095c74471c.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/fc79d507e52ced2fde8f88095c74471c.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/fc79d507e52ced2fde8f88095c74471c.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <i>Sparkfront</i> blends real-time strategy, era-based progression, and tower defense into a compact PvP showdown that rewards timing, adaptation, and all-out aggression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Inspired by classic evolution battle games</strong>, <i>Sparkfront: Online</i> throws players into chaotic 1v1 battles where armies evolve across ages, towers fall, and strategy constantly shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're laughing over voice chat or locked in sweaty battles, every match is a fast, chaotic race to crush your opponent\u2019s tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fight through three unique ages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/2e32ffdbd71c0137efbec701476551df.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/2e32ffdbd71c0137efbec701476551df.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>The Primitive Age</strong> (clubs, spears, raw chaos)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>The Middle Age</strong> (knights, armor, steel clashes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 <strong>The Green Age</strong> (90s-style camo and modern warfare)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7a73751b8bcf7af5905f104996dd5651.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7a73751b8bcf7af5905f104996dd5651.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7a73751b8bcf7af5905f104996dd5651.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Loot drops from defeated enemies add tactical depth \u2014 stackable or single-use items that change the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/e353185f448722c736fb6cd506db5dca.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/e353185f448722c736fb6cd506db5dca.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/e353185f448722c736fb6cd506db5dca.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Shape your path with stat upgrades unlocked at every age \u2014 boost movement speed, turret damage, economy, or item drop rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7e8eadc916a8975c50330ff4f9753f3b.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7e8eadc916a8975c50330ff4f9753f3b.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/7e8eadc916a8975c50330ff4f9753f3b.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Unpredictable Dropbox events spice up each match with sudden XP boosts, extra income, or short bursts of <strong>Frenzy Mode</strong> \u2014 rapid-fire, cost-free unit spam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/fc79d507e52ced2fde8f88095c74471c.poster.avif?t=1752699239\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/fc79d507e52ced2fde8f88095c74471c.webm?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/fc79d507e52ced2fde8f88095c74471c.mp4?t=1752699239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <i>Sparkfront</i> blends real-time strategy, era-based progression, and tower defense into a compact PvP showdown that rewards timing, adaptation, and all-out aggression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
